# Paths Warden should skip when scanning this repository.
#
# Semantics post-M3.1: this file lists paths that are **not agent context
# at all** — binaries, opaque records, vendored output. Files that contain
# attack-shaped content by design (rule data, detector tests, payload
# fixtures) use inline payload-fixture markers instead. See ADR 0010.
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore (see ADR 0006). Negation patterns are not
# honored in M2.

# Bun's binary lockfile — opaque, not agent context.
bun.lock

# The bootstrap prompt is a verbatim record of how this project was kicked
# off, not agent context to be scanned in-place.
warden-bootstrap-prompt.md
